{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "933bdc1d83e193611891d960ef554621ea26f743fdce07f4842507922d3eb224", "ja": "超開幕！　キャスト発表！", "zh": "超级开幕！演员发表！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5f5cec63550f0224fc46aa40714a38dfa742a27283944b0993d64e0fc5750c6a", "ja": "オーディションに合格し、ビーチバレー映画\r\nに出演が決まったアイドルたち。控え室で水\r\n着姿になり、やる気満々な海美、恵美、紗代\r\n子、奈緒。しかし風花は、ひとりだけ恥ずか\r\nしそう。ともあれ、大型企画が動き出した。", "zh": "偶像们通过试镜，将演出沙滩排球电影。\n海美、惠美、纱代子、奈绪\n在准备室换上泳装，个个充满干劲，\n唯独风花似乎还有些害羞。\n无论如何，大型企划就要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e1549cb421e9513596bf719449c9c8af5524dc76eb3195c55dd04dc0ef8878f", "ja": "（各所への報告や依頼が済み、企画が動き始めた！\n今日はキャストの発表だ……みんな集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（对各方面的报告和委托都完成了，企划开始步上轨道！\n今天要公布演员……大家都集合了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "36968a8d27d3ef58defc9f557f5d000d8fc1e00fbd70560309fe5bc72dd956fd", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……うう～、酸欠なっちゃいそう！\n空気入れ、どっかにない？", "zh": "呼，呼……呜呜～我快要缺氧了！\n有没有充气筒啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "b50565d25f198414dde876b55060307cb37a37bbc6c79bab3b0573886ea7c7b5", "ja": "はいはーい！　めぐみー、私に任せてっ！\nすうぅぅ～～……ぷーーーーーーっ！", "zh": "选我选我～！阿惠，包在我身上吧！\n吸～～～吐──────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "4d97c9db8153bb9f264d0aa7f069271dcfb34593cc420eaff56443a2a0a57e6c", "ja": "海美！？　そんな、ひと息で……！\nすごい肺活量だね……。", "zh": "海美！？你居然一口气就……！\n好厉害的肺活量喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "bfb0e58c43f4be8cdee0749d75537b405c42ffc46ab8347ff53fe4587e68b105", "ja": "風花、なんでそんな隅っこにおるん？\nもっとこっち来たらええやん。", "zh": "风花，你为什么要待在角落啊？\n再靠过来一点嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bbc26ba9268d076c58df5a75f3bfd6690ec0519c0f06f3bf562284b441c4f0b9", "ja": "だ、だって、恥ずかしくて……！", "zh": "因、因为，我好害羞……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "477647792d59fabf5a9db1e5290774703ab6f0a2f1367e1cde8beec5eddfe12b", "ja": "（なんだか、騒がしいぞ……？）", "zh": "（好像很热闹……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cda190615edb2496b5a49b23e21d9e28358e2d7489506de249201aa6ef919c3b", "ja": "え……あっ、{$P$}さんっ！？\nきゃあっ！", "zh": "咦……啊，{$P$}先生！？\n哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3ebf7153a776fc5cb2c7ec31f990e1c6820d05085794b68502f36057bef58b53", "ja": "……？\nみんな、何してるんだ？　水着なんか着て……。", "zh": "……？\n你们在做什么啊？怎么穿着泳装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "da69933ddf5ad0cec2a1dc26c1034e145af20217a590a568509f908c5139ac47", "ja": "{$P$}！　お疲れさまっ☆\nいまね、ゴムボートふくらませてたんだ！", "zh": "{$P$}！辛苦啦☆\n我们在帮充气船打气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2ca427e47baaebc95e1607ebfc0a6659c2d3f4d0e0922457e2ac7584c6c4c878", "ja": "そ、そうか。……つまり遊んでたんだな？\nこれから仕事の話をするんだけど。", "zh": "是、是吗……也就是在玩是吧？\n不过马上就要谈工作的事啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "14de56da57804ca02058975c84eec63e5d59f451fb16a17173dd685075c6b976", "ja": "にゃはは、わかってるって！\nでも、ただ遊んでたワケじゃないよ？　ねっ、紗代子！", "zh": "呀哈哈，我知道啦！\n不过，我们可不只是在玩喔？对吧，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "c8fa6c053133ade8205221dfadd65a93c3794592de06d037ec7477440337e249", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}、\n私たち、イメージトレーニングをしていたんです！", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，\n我们在做想像训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "08ad750a5a7673f61cd5cdbe6612155757cc301be8fed395d636e865c8aa41e4", "ja": "せやで！　映画に出演する以上、役に慣れとかんと\nアカンし！　いや～、楽しみやなぁ♪", "zh": "嘿呀！既然要演电影了，就得先融入角色啊！\n哎呀～好期待喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a79094658adb9b40c8fb1027cf8a508ed1fab4cef965538705846975d96c4d94", "ja": "……まだ言ってないのに、なんで知ってるんだ？", "zh": "……我明明还没说，你怎么会知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "93a7a5bc4cab1c19541817660fe5ca1b3443fed66f7e03231444d49f29f5d448", "ja": "あっ。え、えっと～、それは……。", "zh": "啊，呃、呃～是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f5c0cba520fc9036bcbf0267c762d70fd5187f78dd10a738a5dc4139c8ab00db", "ja": "あの、事務室の机に置いてあった企画書……\nみんなで見ちゃいました……！", "zh": "那个，我们都看见了……\n事务室桌上放的企划书……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e78f7fab5c7cbdb1bc4edb52d9d2c0c9d673c38e6be1680ad0e1e8948935ee2", "ja": "いやあの、ただ盗み見たんとちゃいますよ！\n{$P$}さんの考えを読んだんです！", "zh": "不是啦那个，我们不是只有单纯偷看嘿！\n我们还有猜到{$P$}先生在想什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1096569dc2e204d4c1ec9cf2936bd1eb9b0c221a2180973e9885646f5822aa71", "ja": "そうか……まあ、いい。\nで、風花はどこにいるんだ？　声しか聞こえないぞ。", "zh": "是吗……哎，算了。\n是说，风花人在哪里啊？我只有听到她的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "67d5500831424e9631d50b8537fdaa18c7fdcba94bbe9bd79c1557c92c92c17a", "ja": "さっきまで一緒やったんですけどね～。ほら風花～、\nもう覚悟決めんと。どうせ撮影で見られるんやし♪", "zh": "刚才她还跟我们在一起的吼～来啦风花～\n你就下定决心吧，反正拍摄时都会被看见嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a4b6644f3c3cbf8b7da1411cfa61de6cd36f8a31fe9242bfd97f4fe48e97962", "ja": "そ、そうだよね……。うう……。", "zh": "说、说得也是……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "66e8ed00b395cf7c5f198d0dae10f66153ee110ba4ac308dd98618007c9dc686", "ja": "ふむ……なるほど。", "zh": "嗯……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7e2b13d76bd31798c56bc19192530178f84c1a5ec329f5d9b159b5aea7c0719d", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん！\n何がなるほどなんですかぁ～。エッチ！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}！\n什么原来如此啊～你好色喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1b3076e356adb3f12c888b9a447dab5bd3004b46cd1853ecbd0bbf56bf0e6fcd", "ja": "いや、どうしてそうなるんだ！？　その水着は別に、\n俺が選んだわけじゃ……というか、誰の水着なんだ？", "zh": "不是，为什么会出现这种结论！？那套泳装，\n又不是我挑的……应该说，这是谁的泳装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "65d77614f1907a12b06f22848b4aeadd4f63b9ab023f2ce3286457446eab1600", "ja": "これが映画の衣装なんやって！\nさっき美咲さんが届けてくれたんです。", "zh": "听说是电影的戏服喔！\n刚才美咲拿来给我们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ba533dd7239216bc70824c252273c8f785b7253b0965b5fdb29eb7423812bce6", "ja": "もうできてたのか！\nさすが超大作、仕事が早いな……！", "zh": "戏服已经做好了吗！？\n真不愧是超级强档，工作效率好高……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab082ebeda66ec086af709876a96f13ba6c1f3cc943d24d476bfa29eda41d332", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}？\n私たち、この水着でビーチバレーするんだよね！", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，\n我们要穿着这套泳装打沙滩排球对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "8aa5c3a40cc1fce237986b6e4c77575c7be1d1b9b7c7575e8d9fee8dace92860", "ja": "私バレエが得意だから、たぶんバレーもバッチリ\nだと思う！　私のバレーに期待してて☆", "zh": "我很会跳芭蕾，排球应该也能打得很好吧！\n好好期待我的沙滩排球吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6f4be7cc78bbbbbf47eadfdda7b6bc3b7ddedfccf6edd0918c5a14be443f8c02", "ja": "ああ、聞いてるだけだとわかりにくいけど、\n期待してるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然听不懂这两者有什么关联，\n但我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "07975a658194dca1e1e0fcbcdfbd4ed82a83bf6d47953529a1b1d58d38d7bf19", "ja": "{$P$}、ホントありがとね！\n映画なんておっきな仕事、取るの大変だったっしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}，真的很谢谢你！\n要争取到拍电影这种重要工作，肯定很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "74a9d23df465a93602d1f341ad0523f581d2815eeb84690d2f48682c298333ff", "ja": "いや、この仕事は、みんなが実力で勝ち取ったんだ。\n気にしなくていいぞ。", "zh": "不，这份工作是大家用实力赢来的，\n你不用放在心上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "9a73f2d36e951e26b23f4894e820b93d0d5c400f839f743ab3d0881ef47b503f", "ja": "でも、{$P$}がたくさん\n頑張ってくれたことも本当ですから……。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}做了很多努力，\n这也是事实啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "b12b50056ff9c7231bdfa73fe226fd814ec1033f370a054a9ab601eaa821a651", "ja": "私たちは絶対、その期待に応えてみせますね！\n期待しててください、{$P$}！", "zh": "所以我们绝对会回应你的期待的！\n请好好期待吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b8aa80ff1fa07a39b1f43f8dda56b6ff7f000eb5df3c06cc9b5943f3c143e978", "ja": "……ありがとう。みんなの気合いのほどはわかったよ。\nなにしろ、もう着替えてるくらいだし。", "zh": "……谢谢你们，我明白你们多有干劲了。\n毕竟连衣服都已经换好了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6aaea3620e36a04b5fe06b487bcb68f467b4ebcb7c8bfee335436db96b5d9dba", "ja": "でも、ここからだぞ！\n撮影以外にも、タイアップ公演も企画してるんだ。", "zh": "不过，现在才刚开始喔！\n除了拍摄电影之外，还有合作宣传公演的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "30271f3bfc2349231b2df73e812fa50a534daade5a390c31ae5eb4d85a1f711b", "ja": "やることが多くて大変だと思うが、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "要做的事很多，可能会很辛苦，但我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_01_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c4c2128d7be5ec963c39a1b3eb099e5e7b53fef07f17f53c6eb617af9695248", "ja": "はいっ☆", "zh": "好的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
